# The Age a kept answer carries (a store's own mark, there on a kept page and not on one made),
# dropped so that the first and second answer of a store with room compare; the after-turn check
# in run-pair.sh asks for it where the configuration says it must be there.
/^age: [0-9]*$/d
s/^etag: W\/"[0-9a-f]*"$/etag: W\/"<keyed per process (cache.rs TAG_KEY)>"/
